@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
interface EnvironmentSensor {
 +init(): Error
 +readForced(out): Error
}
interface I2cBus {
 +read(...): bool
 +write(...): bool
}
interface Clock {
 +delayUs(us)
}
class Bmp280
class FakeSensor
class BmpCalibration
class ArduinoI2cBus
class RouterI2cBus
class ArduinoClock
class SystemClock
EnvironmentSensor <|.. Bmp280
EnvironmentSensor <|.. FakeSensor
Bmp280 o-left-> I2cBus : borrows
Bmp280 o-right-> Clock : borrows
Bmp280 *-down- BmpCalibration : owns
I2cBus <|.. ArduinoI2cBus
I2cBus <|.. RouterI2cBus
Clock <|.. ArduinoClock
Clock <|.. SystemClock
note bottom of BmpCalibration
 Only calibration is owned.
 Bus and clock outlive Bmp280.
 No platform includes in core.
end note
@enduml
